@startuml 01_incident_architecture
title 29 Sep: where it broke
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica

actor "Kalkulio ops\n(Marta's team)" as ops
node "Kalkulio" {
  component "CRM" as crm
  component "Status API\nPOST /callbot/calls\nGET /callbot/leads/{id}" as kapi
}

node "Born Digital platform" {
  package "Core product (shared by many clients)" {
    component "outbound-api\n1 replica, 800Mi\nhandle_partial_update_campaign" as oapi
    database "Campaign document\n(~10k numbers)" as camp
  }
  component "Dialer" as dialer
  package "Per client (ours, Engagement)" {
    component "Voicebot flow" as bot
    component "Status step\n(no retry)" as step
  }
}

crm --> oapi : push lead\n(per lead since 25 Sep,\n~890/h at 09-11 UTC)
oapi --> camp : load whole doc,\nappend 1, save
oapi --> dialer
dialer --> bot : call
bot --> oapi : 1. PATCH call result
step --> oapi : 2. reload call record
step --> kapi : 3. POST status
kapi --> crm
ops --> crm : works the leads

note right of oapi
  <b>Outage root cause</b>
  memory grows with concurrent pushes
  14 OOMKills 08:55-11:05
end note
note bottom of step
  <b>Data loss root cause</b>
  step 2 failed -> "status delivery skipped"
  1,611 deliveries lost, payload was already in the flow
end note
@enduml
